<h1><a href='https://uknowledge.uky.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1050&amp;context=physiology_etds'>Novel Mammalian Models for Understanding and Treating Spinal Cord Injury</a></h1>
</div>
<div class='clear'></div>
